## Summary

Run Product A across all 647 active policy wordings to measure scale readiness. This task is diagnostic: attempt every active policy or record why it was skipped, produce per-stage success/failure metrics, classify failure modes, and identify the highest-leverage next fixes.

DSE-020 does not require manual annotation of all PDFs. It must not weaken existing 20-policy gold gates. It must not overwrite reviewed benchmark outputs.

